{% doc %}
  Renders a decorative social brand icon in currentColor. The social-links
  snippet owns its accessible link name and the icon's dimensions.

  @param {string} icon - facebook, instagram, tiktok, youtube, pinterest, x, or linkedin.
{% enddoc %}

